{"id":"vod_bf_37960","vodId":"37960","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"夏目友人帐第二季","name_cn":"夏目友人帐第二季","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/fee72cd59f455575b308d28817195cd8.jpg"},"summary":"夏目的祖母玲子可以看见妖怪，并有很强的力量。但是被周围人疏远的她很早就离开了人世，只留下一本友人帐。友人帐里记录了曾经被玲子打败的妖怪的名字，且这些妖怪必须守护友人帐的主人。玲子去世后，这本友人帐留给了夏目。强大的友人帐吸引了各种妖怪的造访，给夏目带来不少麻烦，但是也引领夏目不断成长着。　　夏目追寻妖怪的记忆不断了解自己的祖母玲子，由于异于常人的禀赋，玲子在人群中总是形单影只异常的孤单。深深理解玲子的夏目一心想要找到能够理解自己内心的人，也在这个过程中看到自己和祖母的不同之处。虽然生命似乎总是弥漫着孤寂的味道，但是如果找到想要守护的人，那是很幸福的吧。　　在这样一个由冬入春的时节，夏目和他的猫咪老师带给我们一阵阵暖流。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:52:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xiamuyourenzhangdierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.r